  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Audience Chamber member of Topkapi Q170495, OSM way103907818/native35184475996650. Native parent is the approximately31.4x29.2m canopy footprint with chamfered rear corners. Internal+X follows its long front elevation southeast; internal+Z faces southwest toward the separate Gate of Felicity. World heading0/native+X east,+Z south. Two ordinary exterior photos inspected; column/arch/door/canopy treatment is specific to this chamber.",
    "architecturalHeights": "No qualified native architectural height. Picture-led podium1.2m above front reference, shaft/capital/arch spring near6.6m, arcade crown8.2m, soffit8.9m and low hip roof near10.8m. Enclosed chamber21x16.2m and22 working column positions/eight front-row columns are footprint/photo-led visualization controls, not verified dimensions or inventory. Fine capitals, roof plan, painted art and hidden interior arrangement remain approximate."
